      "note": "Common phrases: 风险测评 (risk assessment), 有风险 (risky), 控制风险 (control risk), 承担风险 (bear risk).",
      "examples": [
        {
          "zh": "买理财产品以前，要先做风险测评。",
          "py": "Mǎi lǐcái chǎnpǐn yǐqián, yào xiān zuò fēngxiǎn cèpíng.",
          "en": "Before buying a wealth-management product, you must first take a risk assessment."
        },
        {
          "zh": "金价波动很大，投资黄金有一定的风险。",
          "py": "Jīnjià bōdòng hěn dà, tóuzī huángjīn yǒu yídìng de fēngxiǎn.",
          "en": "Gold prices swing a lot, so investing in gold carries some risk."
        },
        {
          "zh": "骑车不戴头盔很有风险。",
          "py": "Qí chē bú dài tóukuī hěn yǒu fēngxiǎn.",
          "en": "Riding a bike without a helmet is quite risky."
        }
      ]
